Description: NimbusOS desktop system (metapackage)
 Installs everything NimbusOS consists of: the KDE Plasma desktop with
 the Nimbus Dark theme, Docker CE, KVM/QEMU with libvirt, Samba with
 mergerfs and SnapRAID, the Nimbus Control Center and its app catalog, and
 the NimbusOS update channel.
 .
 Its dependency list is generated from the live image's package lists, so
 the image and installed systems always contain the same software, and a
 package added to NimbusOS reaches existing installations with their next
 update.
